A-2002:295 提供的更新；Mandrake 用户应用 MDKSA-2003:001 补丁；SuSE 用户安装 2003_002_cups 安全更新。如无法升级，在防火墙中限制 UDP 端口 631 的入站访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接 CUPS 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6436","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10908","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1367","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6234ce2445fa5b07373d0bc9dc7ce8354bab0ff7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qjpg-cf6h-2fr2/GHSA-qjpg-cf6h-2fr2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/suse_SA_2003_002.nasl","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bcb64bafc58ae2d79f28acef13f93508b4e4cfbe/2002/CVE-2002-1367.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1370.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-001.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cups_vulns.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0075","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1366","title":"CUPS 本地竞争条件漏洞导致任意文件写入","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本中存在条件竞争漏洞。具有 lp 打印机服务权限的本地攻击者可通过文件条件竞争攻击，在 CUPS 处理打印任务的过程中利用时间窗口差，将任意系统文件覆盖或创建为新文件，从而提升权限或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限，但成功利用后可实现完全机密性、完整性和可用性破坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1366"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11.180","remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本。各发行版对应：Debian 安装 cupsys 更新包（DSA-232），Red Hat 应用 RHSA-2002:295 更新，SuSE 安装 2003_002 安全补丁，Mandrake 应用 MDKSA-2003:001。如无法升级，移除 lp 用户组中非必要用户的 lp 权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10907","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1366.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1366","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39aab03fcd8441626e5dea87058d434f682ec433/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qq4v-v49x-w99c/GHSA-qq4v-v49x-w99c.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/suse_SA_2003_002.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1366.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-001.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cups_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0075.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0075.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0082","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1381","title":"Exim Internet Mailer 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Exim 邮件服务器 daemon.c 组件中存在格式字符串漏洞，具有管理员权限的本地攻击者可通过修改 pid_file_path 参数值触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Exim 4.x 至 4.10 版本及 3.x 至 3.36 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备 exim 管理用户权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1381"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13.233","remediation":"升级 Exim 至 4.11 或更高版本（4.x 系列）或 3.37 或更高版本（3.x 系列），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，严格限制 exim 管理用户权限，禁止非授权用户修改 pid_file_path 等配置参数，并监控 syslog 中异常的 exim 进程行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://groups.yahoo.com/group/exim-users/message/42358","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103903403527788&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104006219018664&w=2","http://www.exim.org/pipermail/exim-users/Week-of-Mon-20021202/046978.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6314","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10761","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22066","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1381.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1381","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f085197f4312eebb5b5d2a4ae57205b512d529b1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qggr-hj4x-gf78/GHSA-qggr-hj4x-gf78.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1381.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1381","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6943dc6b-fb23-41cb-a30b-f2fc3e1bebe0.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0081","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1377","title":"Vim 模式行 libcall 功能任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Vim 6.0 及 6.1 版本（可能包括其他版本）的 modeline 功能中存在命令执行漏洞。modeline 中的 libcall 特性未受到沙箱机制限制，当用户使用 vim 打开恶意构造的文件时（如通过 mutt 邮件客户端查看恶意邮件），攻击者可利用该漏洞在用户系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞利用条件要求用户主动打开恶意文件，属于本地攻击向量，影响范围广泛。建议升级至不受影响的版本或禁用 modeline 功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1377"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12.723","remediation":"升级 vim 至 6.2 及以上版本（Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:302 提供的修补包）。如无法升级，在 ~/.vimrc 或系统级 vimrc 中添加 `set modelines=0` 以完全禁用 modeline 功能，这是最有效的临时缓解措施，可阻断所有通过 modeline 执行的恶意命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000812","http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2002-December/002948.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=108077992208690&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/55700","http://www.guninski.com/vim1.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:012","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-297.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-302.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6384","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10835","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1377","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/32851.txt","https://github.com/numirias/security/blob/92c6d4505a63892427382a0c8f975a8009533e2b/doc/2019-06-04_ace-vim-neovim.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d99b1b66d0cac20b8bc92baa53c2887e8bf76b6d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3g8f-84mq-ghvw/GHSA-3g8f-84mq-ghvw.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-302.nasl","https://github.com/alexyoung/usevim/blob/7cdff5fbdcec0a0873bb903b41e21715feddcae7/_posts/2012-03-28-modelines.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0074","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1365","title":"Fetchmail 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.1.3 及更早版本中存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理邮件头中大量本地地址时，未将 \"@\" 字符计入缓冲区长度计算，导致缓冲区分配不足。远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送特制的邮件头，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Fetchmail 6.1.3 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1365"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11.030","remediation":"升级 Fetchmail 至 6.2.0 或更高版本。Debian 用户运行 apt-get update && apt-get install fetchmail 安装 DSA-216 提供的更新包；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:293/RHSA-2002:294 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:011 更新。如无法升级，可在邮件服务器上限制邮件头中收件人地址数量，或禁用 fetchmail 对本地地址的缓冲区处理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000554","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103979751818638&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004858802000&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/052002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-216","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:011","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-293.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-294.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-155.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6390","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10839","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1365.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1365","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qf2w-6gx5-q88j/GHSA-qf2w-6gx5-q88j.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/suse_SA_2003_001.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1365.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-294.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-216.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0073","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1350","title":"LBL tcpdump BGP 解析器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tcpdump 3.6.x 版本（3.7 之前）的 BGP 协议解析例程中存在数据复制缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 BGP 协议报文触发该漏洞，导致 tcpdump 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 tcpdump 3.6 至 3.6.2.2.2 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 tcpdump 3.7 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1350"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:09.227","remediation":"升级 tcpdump 至 3.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了 BGP 解析器中的数据复制缺陷。各 Linux 发行版用户应通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade tcpdump`，Red Hat/CentOS 执行 `yum update tcpdump`。如无法升级，可在边界防火墙上过滤 TCP 端口 179 (BGP) 的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032975103398&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-206","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:027","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-032.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-033.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6213","http://www.tcpdump.org/lists/workers/2001/10/msg00101.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10695","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1350.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1350","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1350.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1350.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-206.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-r67j-rqm9-w8mr/GHSA-r67j-rqm9-w8mr.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-033.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6182fcf5-15eb-4d37-9f86-fa9b9247ea34.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1350.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0071","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1347","title":"Cyrus SASL 库缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus SASL 库 2.1.9 及更早版本中存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送过长的用户名、特殊 LDAP 认证字符或触发日志记录器中的一次未分配空终止符等途径远程利用此漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用该 SASL 库的各种应用系统，攻击无需任何权限或用户交互即可实现，利用面极广，严重威胁系统安全稳定性和完整性，系统可被完全破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1347"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08.827","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cyrus SASL 库至 2.1.10 或更高版本（如 2.1.28），可通过包管理器执行 `yum update cyrus-sasl` 或 `apt-get install cyrus-sasl2`。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用受影响的 SASL 认证机制（如 DIGEST-MD5、CRAM-MD5），或在网络层限制对 SASL 认证端口（如 25、143、993 端口）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2002-q4/1275.html","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2005/Mar/msg00000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103946297703402&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-215","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-283.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4826","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6347","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6348","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6349","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10810","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10811","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/C