 curl 替代 wget 进行 FTP 文件传输作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0102.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000552","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000552","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103962838628940&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104033016703851&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-022.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10820.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/210148","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-086.php","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2003.007.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-229.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-256.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/307045/30/26300/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6352","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6360","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1344","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-209.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-m2vp-q7mm-qrpv/GHSA-m2vp-q7mm-qrpv.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-256.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--638d6ab0-047f-43ba-8970-888462a04eff.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-209.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0069","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1342","title":"smb2www smb2www 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"smb2www 980804-16 及更早版本存在未知代码执行漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可利用该漏洞在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞源于 smb2www 对用户输入缺乏有效过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发送恶意请求触发漏洞，攻击复杂度低，可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性均受到部分影响（CVSS 7.5，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P）。受影响范围为 smb2www 980804-16 及更早版本，攻击者可远程执行任意系统命令获取服务器控制权。Debian 已发布 DSA-203 等安全公告修复该漏洞，Nessus 等扫描器已收录检测插件（如 smb2www_cmd_exec.nasl、debian_DSA-203.nasl）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1342"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08.430","remediation":"建议立即升级 smb2www 至 980804-16 之后的版本（如 980804-17 或更新版本），或从官方源获取修补补丁。若无法升级，请在防火墙层面限制对 smb2www 服务端口的访问，或暂时禁用该服务以防止远程命令执行攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-203","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10768.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6313","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1342.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1342","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1342.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9