以 bin 用户身份执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Canna 3.5b2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞提升权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1158"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:51.370","remediation":"升级 Canna 至 3.5b2-46.2 及以上版本（Debian Woody）或安装 RHSA-2002:261 提供的修复 RPM 包（Red Hat Linux Advanced Server 2.1）。如无法立即升级，可移除 Canna 软件包或限制本地用户对 Canna 服务的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://canna.sourceforge.jp/sec/Canna-2002-01.txt","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104041812206344&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-224","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-246.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-261.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6351","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10831","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1158","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1158.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1158.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1158","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-85vx-vq88-55q2/GHSA-85vx-vq88-55q2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-261.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-224.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1158.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x7000/6351/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0067","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1336","title":"TightVNC 认证绕过漏洞","description":"TightVNC 1.2.6 之前版本存在安全绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于服务端在多个连接中生成相同的 challenge 字符串，远程攻击者可通过嗅探其他用户的 challenge 与 response 数据，利用该固定 challenge 绕过 VNC 认证机制，从而在无需合法凭据的情况下获取对目标系统的远程访问权限。该漏洞影响所有使用 TightVNC 1.2.6 之前版本的系统，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，无需身份认证，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1336"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:07.640","remediation":"升级 TightVNC 至 1.2.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了每次连接生成相同 challenge 字符串的问题。如无法立即升级，应通过 SSH 隧道或 VPN 封装 VNC 流量，防止攻击者嗅探网络中的 challenge/response 数据；同时在防火墙层面限制 VNC 端口（默认 5900/TCP）仅允许受信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000640","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102753170201524&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102769183913594&w=2","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:022","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-287.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-041.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5296","http://www.tightvnc.com/WhatsNew.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1336","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13e